{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ResilientPaywallService"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":" populates "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallState"},{"type":"text","text":" — and therefore the feature gate,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"account display, and whether the paywall sheet is shown — entirely from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"snapshots its wrapped service emits. A slow, silent, or throwing entitlement"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read at cold launch leaves that state at its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"free"},{"type":"text","text":" default. This decorator"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps a persisted last-known-good so the gate never collapses to free on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transient failure, while the server remains the authoritative gate: a later"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"live snapshot always overwrites the cache, so a genuine lapse is honoured."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The cache is bounded by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxCacheAge"},{"type":"text","text":" (72 hours by default): a stale cache"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stops vouching for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPro"},{"type":"text","text":" — subscriptions lapse, and an install that stays"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offline past the bound must not keep pro forever — but keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasPermanentLicense"},{"type":"text","text":", because lifetime purchases don’t expire."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Provider-agnostic by construction — it speaks only "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":", so it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wraps any base (simulated, RevenueCat, StoreKit, …). Feed the wrapped instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"both"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":" and any app-side reader that builds a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"monetization\/context payload from entitlements."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Back the cache with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyValueStore"},{"type":"text","text":" rather than "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UserDefaults"},{"type":"text","text":": the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cache vouches for a paid entitlement offline, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UserDefaults"},{"type":"text","text":" is a plist"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a user can edit or restore from a doctored backup, whereas the Keychain is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"encrypted and not plist-editable. (On unsigned macOS dev builds the Keychain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can return "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"errSecMissingEntitlement"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ −34018 — see "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sandboxing &"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entitlements (macOS)"}]},{"type":"text","text":" on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyValueStore"},{"type":"text","text":".)"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let resilient = ResilientPaywallService(","    base: paywallService,","    store: KeychainKeyValueStore(service: \"com.example.myapp\")",")","\/\/ PaywallPlugin(..., service: resilient)   \/\/ gate + account display","\/\/ await resilient.currentSnapshot()        \/\/ server payload, off-main"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"text":"Threat model","anchor":"Threat-model","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Backed by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyValueStore"},{"type":"text","text":", the cache defends against casual plist"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editing and a doctored-backup restore: the persisted last-known-good is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"encrypted and not a user-editable file. It does "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}]},{"type":"text","text":" defend against a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"jailbroken device — nothing client-side does; entitlements can always be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forged on a device the attacker fully controls. The live provider stays"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authoritative whenever the app is online: any live snapshot overwrites the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cache, so a genuine lapse or downgrade is honoured on the next successful"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasPermanentLicense"},{"type":"text","text":" deliberately never expires — a lifetime purchase"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"must keep working offline indefinitely."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Wraps a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" so a transient failure to read entitlements never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presents a previously-seen paid user as free."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall"]]},"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ResilientPaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"ResilientPaywallService","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ResilientPaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPaywall"}],"externalID":"s:13SwiduxPaywall09ResilientB7ServiceV","symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure"},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/currentSnapshot()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfo()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfoStream()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/restorePurchases()"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice"]}],"references":{"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/PaywallState":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PaywallState"}],"title":"PaywallState","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallState","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PaywallState"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Current paywall state — entitlement status, sheet presentation, and async progress."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/paywallstate"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s16SendableMetatypeP","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService","title":"ResilientPaywallService","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Wraps a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" so a transient failure to read entitlements never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presents a previously-seen paid user as free."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"ResilientPaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ResilientPaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/customerInfoStream()":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/customerinfostream()","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfoStream()","title":"customerInfoStream()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Long-lived stream of entitlement updates. Yields the persisted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"last-known-good first (when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"seedsFromCache"},{"type":"text","text":" is on and the cache is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still usable), then forwards and persists every snapshot the base"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stream emits."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"customerInfoStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","text":"AsyncStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","text":"EntitlementSnapshot"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall","title":"SwiduxPaywall","abstract":[],"type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)":{"title":"init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/init(base:store:maxattempts:seedsfromcache:maxcacheage:retrybasedelay:now:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a resilient decorator around "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"base"},{"type":"text","text":", persisting last-known-good"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"base"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall0B7ServiceP","text":"PaywallService"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"store"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux13KeyValueStoreP","text":"KeyValueStore"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"maxAttempts"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"seedsFromCache"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"maxCacheAge"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV","text":"Duration"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"retryBaseDelay"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"Duration","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"now","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DateV","text":"Date"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/PaywallPlugin":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PaywallPlugin","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"PaywallPlugin","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PaywallPlugin"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Swidux plugin that manages paywall state and entitlement checking."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/paywallplugin"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/PaywallService":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PaywallService"}],"title":"PaywallService","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PaywallService"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Provider-agnostic paywall service protocol."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/paywallservice"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/customerInfo()":{"title":"customerInfo()","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfo()","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"customerInfo","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntitlementSnapshot","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Fetches the current entitlement status, retrying up to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxAttempts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with exponential backoff. On success persists and returns; if every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attempt fails, returns the cached last-known-good when present and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"usable, otherwise rethrows (so the plugin’s honest "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".refreshFailed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"path is preserved for a genuinely-unknown user). Cancellation stops"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"retrying immediately and falls through to the cache."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/customerinfo()"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/restorePurchases()":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/restorepurchases()","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/restorePurchases()","title":"restorePurchases()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Restores previously completed purchases, forwarding to the base service."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Persists on success; rethrows on failure (a restore is an explicit user"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"action, so the plugin keeps the prior state)."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"restorePurchases"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","text":"EntitlementSnapshot"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/s8SendableP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/currentSnapshot()":{"title":"currentSnapshot()","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/currentSnapshot()","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/currentsnapshot()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Non-throwing read for callers that always want a snapshot, degrading to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"free only for a genuinely-unknown user. Convenient for building a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"per-request monetization context off the main actor."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"currentSnapshot"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","text":"EntitlementSnapshot"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"}}}